# Links that answer an automated check with 403 or a challenge page whatever
# the link's state. One regular expression per line, matched against the link
# as written, not where it redirects. Each entry is a link the weekly check
# cannot see, so add one only after it has failed that way.
^https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*medium\.com/
^https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*apa\.org/
^https?://journals\.sagepub\.com/
# DOIs that resolve to journals.sagepub.com: SAGE's own prefix, and the
# Administrative Science Quarterly paper registered under JSTOR's prefix.
^https?://doi\.org/10\.1177/
^https?://doi\.org/10\.2307/2666999$
